TI  - Police as contributors to Healthy Communities: Aiken, South Carolina.
AU  - Frommer P
AU  - Papouchado K
PY  - 2000 Mar-Jun
JO  - Public health reports (Washington, D.C. : 1974)
VL  - 115
IS  - 2-3
SP  - 249-52
