TI  - Intergenerational neuroimaging study: mother-infant functional connectivity similarity and the role of infant and maternal factors.
AU  - Kim P
AU  - Chen H
AU  - Dufford AJ
AU  - Tribble R
AU  - Gilmore J
AU  - Gao W
