TI  - Home Reading Environment and Brain Activation in Preschool Children Listening to Stories.
AU  - Hutton JS
AU  - Horowitz-Kraus T
AU  - Mendelsohn AL
AU  - DeWitt T
AU  - Holland SK
PY  - 2015 Sep
JO  - Pediatrics
VL  - 136
