TI  - Perioperative Course and Socioeconomic Status Predict Long-Term Neurodevelopment Better Than Perioperative Conventional Neuroimaging in Children with Congenital Heart Disease.
AU  - Neukomm A
AU  - Ehrler M
AU  - Feldmann M
AU  - Chaouch A
AU  - Knirsch W
AU  - Hagmann C
