TI  - Autism Detection in Early Childhood (ADEC) in a Low-Income Spanish-Speaking Population in Guayaquil (Ecuador).
AU  - Mata-Iturralde S
AU  - Alonso-Esteban Y
AU  - Alcantud-Marín F
