TI  - Examining resting-state network connectivity in children exposed to perinatal maternal adversity using anatomically weighted functional connectivity (awFC) analyses; A preliminary report.
AU  - Ayyash S
AU  - Sunderji A
AU  - Gallant HD
AU  - Hall A
