TI  - Perioperative neonatal brain injury is associated with worse school-age neurodevelopment in children with critical congenital heart disease.
AU  - Claessens NHP
AU  - Algra SO
AU  - Ouwehand TL
AU  - Jansen NJG
AU  - Schappin R
AU  - Haas F
AU  - Eijsermans MJC
