TI  - Early severe institutional deprivation is associated with a persistent variant of adult attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder: clinical presentation, developmental continuities and life circumstances in the English and Romanian Adoptees study.
AU  - Kennedy M
AU  - Kreppner J
AU  - Knights N
AU  - Kumsta R
AU  - Maughan B
