TI  - The principles of Nurturing Care promote human capital and mitigate adversities from preconception through adolescence
AU  - Black, MM
AU  - Behrman, JR
AU  - Daelmans, B
AU  - Prado, EL
AU  - Richter, L
AU  - Tomlinson, M
