TI  - Disparities in first evaluation of infants with cystic fibrosis since implementation of newborn screening
AU  - McColley, SA
AU  - Martiniano, SL
AU  - Ren, CL
AU  - Sontag, MK
AU  - Rychlik, K
AU  - Balmert, L
AU  - Elbert, A
