TI  - Regional Cortical Thickness Correlates of Intellectual Abilities Differ in Children With Traumatic Brain Injury Versus Those With Orthopedic Injury in the Chronic Post-Injury Phase
AU  - Merkley, T.L.
AU  - Halter, C.
AU  - Graul, B.
