TI  - Exposure to mixed metals/metalloids in early childhood: a cross-sectional cohort study in children from Sevilla, Southern Spain
AU  - Quintana-Mejía, M.
AU  - Hinojosa, M.G.
AU  - Garrido, A.I.
AU  - González, M.
AU  - Millán, A.
