TI  - Childhood executive control and adolescent substance use initiation: the mediating roles of physical and relational aggression and prosocial behavior
AU  - Patwardhan, I.
AU  - Guo, Y.
AU  - Hamburger, E.R.
AU  - Sarwar, S.
AU  - Fleming, C.B.
