TI  - Long-Term Behavioral and Neurophysiological Outcomes Following Cochlear Reimplantation in Children: An EEG Study With Predictive Factor Analysis
AU  - Yao, X.
AU  - Liu, H.
AU  - Gu, F.
AU  - Jin, Y.
AU  - Zhang, X.
AU  - Ni, T.
AU  - Si, J.
