TI  - Socioeconomic factors, brain-derived neurotrophic factor Val66Met polymorphism, and cortical structure in children and adolescents
AU  - Merz, E.C.
AU  - Morys, F.
AU  - Hansen, M.
AU  - Strack, J.
AU  - Jacobs, L.
AU  - Vainik, U.
