TI  - Cognitive development in children with new-onset Rolandic epilepsy and Rolandic discharges without seizures: Focusing on intelligence, visual perception, working memory and the role of parents’ education
AU  - Neumann, H.
AU  - Daseking, M.
AU  - Thiels, C.
