TI  - Intergenerational Transmission of Maternal Childhood Maltreatment Prior to Birth: Effects on Human Fetal Amygdala Functional Connectivity
AU  - van den Heuvel, M.I.
AU  - Monk, C.
AU  - Hendrix, C.L.
AU  - Hect, J.
AU  - Lee, S.
