TI  - Impact of dioxin exposure on brain morphometry and social anxiety in men living in the most dioxin-contaminated area in Vietnam
AU  - Vu, H.T.
AU  - Pham, T.N.
AU  - Nishijo, M.
AU  - Yokawa, T.
AU  - Pham The, T.
