TI  - Infant iron deficiency, iron supplementation, and psychosocial stress as predictors of neurocognitive development in Chilean adolescents
AU  - Doom, J.R.
AU  - Gahagan, S.
AU  - Caballero, G.
AU  - Encina, P.
