TI  - Genetic influences on prefrontal activation during a verbal fluency task in children: A twin study using near-infrared spectroscopy
AU  - Sakakibara, E.
AU  - Takizawa, R.
AU  - Kawakubo, Y.
AU  - Kuwabara, H.
AU  - Kono, T.
AU  - Hamada, K.
