TI  - Comparing neighborhood and state contexts for women living with and without HIV: Understanding the southern HIV epidemic
AU  - Ludema, C.
AU  - Edmonds, A.
AU  - Cole, S.R.
AU  - Eron, J.J.
AU  - Adedimeji, A.A.
AU  - Cohen, J.
