TI  - Clinical and neurophysiologic features of active convulsive epilepsy in rural Kenya: A population-based study
AU  - Munyoki, G.
AU  - Edwards, T.
AU  - White, S.
AU  - Kwasa, T.
AU  - Chengo, E.
AU  - Kokwaro, G.
