TI  - Neurodevelopmental outcome of patients after the Fontan operation: A comparison between children with hypoplastic left heart syndrome and other functional single ventricle lesions
AU  - Goldberg, C.S.
AU  - Schwartz, E.M.
AU  - Brunberg, J.A.
